I have encountered a segmentation violation error on Nethack version 2.2
while wearing a ring of conflict.  My chracter was standing in a treasure
zoo, and all the monsters in the room except for two dragons were dead.
The two dragons were standing next to each other after a third dragon had
been killed, and my character, a wizard, stood a few spaces away.  After
two moves, the two dragons moved _away_ from each other and I received the
segmentation violation error.


